<section image-layout="blank" id="UotTMWoZcz"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="N3b49-LU3U"><h2>Three leadership choices unlock the next quarter</h2><p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative decision asks and targets — not company data.</b></p><h3 role="subheading">The package addresses adoption, discounting, and expansion capacity together.</h3><table borders="rows" striped="false" col-widths="[12,25,20,16,27]"><tr><th>Decision</th><th>Choice</th><th>Risk or driver</th><th>Commitment</th><th>Illustrative target</th></tr><tr><td background-color="accent"><p><b>APPROVE</b></p></td><td><p><b>Fund the onboarding intervention</b><br/>Create a dedicated pod.</p></td><td><p>Adoption<br/>18 days versus 14-day target</p></td><td><p><b>$0.4M</b></p></td><td><p>Reach 14 days and recover 1 retention point.</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="accent"><p><b>APPROVE</b></p></td><td><p><b>Protect price discipline</b><br/>Require CFO exceptions.</p></td><td><p>Discounting<br/>Visible margin leak</p></td><td><p><b>12%</b> guardrail</p></td><td><p>Protect 0.3 margin points.</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="accent"><p><b>CONFIRM</b></p></td><td><p><b>Rebalance commercial capacity</b><br/>Shift open roles to expansion.</p></td><td><p>Expansion coverage<br/>Retention constraint</p></td><td><p><b>2 open roles</b></p></td><td><p>Make expansion the next unit of commercial capacity.</p></td></tr></table></grid-item></grid></section>